	(gr_text "51 x 153mm placement, 1.6mm board; 4 x 3.2mm M3 NPTH, centres 4mm from edges.\nNo isolation slot. L-shaped 8mm separation is a layout target, not safety certification.\nJ3/J4/J6/J8/J14 removed to match schematic. Load neutral and PE wiring are off-board.\nT1 follows Hahn-E.pdf scheme 1: four fitted pins, 1/5 primary and 7/9 secondary.\nPump snubber only: C4 R463F222000N0M, 22nF X2 310VAC, P10mm, 13x4x9mm.\nR14/R25: 100R + 100R, 1206; pulse-rated MPN/qualification still required.\nPico across width: ADC row faces sensors, existing GPIO0/2/3 face MOCs. No GPIO reassignment.\n40 THT pins, elevated headers; no carrier components underneath. USB exits right edge.\nRadio/antenna-side half: no copper; USB-side half: signal routing allowed, no planes.\nHeader stack height, cable envelopes, RF performance and heatsink mechanics require final confirmation.\nUNROUTED. Mains conductor widths, protective-device ratings and thermal design are not qualified."
		(at 232.5 152 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "33950f6f-8056-4fa6-bb5d-1b0f27c8e81c")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Q1/Q2/Q3: common tab plane Y=0.85mm; mounting centres X=14/25.5/37mm"
		(at 70 50.5 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "48b6aab1-04c8-49e1-a558-32b089853dd6")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
